 "description": "Persist a Grade quote for an owned saved ticketId or exactly one confirmed manual ticket, with the requested depth and optional funding. May save that manual ticket. Returns the app allowance quote; does not start work. Show the quote before requesting a start. Keep the caller-generated commandKey (16-120 characters) stable for this action and all retries. Action and version are fixed by this tool; do not supply them.",
